# Gmail SMTP — used to send the 4-digit password-reset code.
# 1. Fill MAIL_USERNAME with your Gmail address.
# 2. Fill MAIL_PASSWORD with a Gmail App Password (NOT your normal Gmail
#    password) — generate one at myaccount.google.com/apppasswords.
# 3. Change MAIL_MAILER below from "log" to "smtp" once both are filled in.
# Until then, emails just get logged to storage/logs/laravel.log instead of sent.
